<ul>
<li>When an app automation is in charge of the fans, the menu bar panel says so once, right under the title, with that app&#x27;s icon. Click it to open the automation.</li>
<li>The profile picker and status line step aside while an automation runs, instead of showing the app&#x27;s name as if it were a profile.</li>
<li>The menu bar panel&#x27;s header now carries MacBreeze&#x27;s own menu bar icon.</li>
<li>After each update, MacBreeze shows what changed, in a window like this one.</li>
